During the writing of this thesis, I occasionally used large language models, such as ChatGPT, to help refine the style and clarity of the introduction and conclusion sections. These tools were used solely for language polishing.
All scientific ideas, formulations, and arguments are entirely my own, and I have independently verified the accuracy and integrity of the content.
No such tools were used in the technical chapters.
